  "mainHtml": "<main class=\"bg-white\"><div class=\"bg-off-white\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1 mb-8 pt-8 lg:mb-16 breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/de/questions\">Häufige Frage</a><i class=\"icon\">chevron_right</i><a href=\"/de/question_categories/buying\">Einkaufen</a><i class=\"icon\">chevron_right</i><span>What does the Professional seller label mean on a listing?</span></div><div class=\"lg:flex gap-16 mb-16\"><div class=\"lg:w-3/4\"><h1 class=\"font-serif text-5xl mb-8\">What does the Professional seller label mean on a listing?</h1><div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-8 auction-body\"><p>It means the <strong>seller is a company</strong> (e.g., a car dealer or another business)\noffering the item.</p>\n<p><strong>What it means for you as a buyer (short):</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li>When you buy from a <strong>business</strong>, Swedish <strong>consumer law</strong> (Consumer Purchase Act)\n  applies.</li>\n  <li>When you buy from a <strong>private seller</strong>, the <strong>Sale of Goods Act</strong> applies and\n  protections are less extensive.</li>\n  <li>Legally, buying from a <strong>professional seller</strong> provides <strong>stronger protection</strong>\n  due to mandatory consumer law.</li>\n  <li><strong>Professional dealers</strong> often offer <strong>financing</strong> (arranged directly with the\n  dealer).</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Good to know:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li>As a bidder you have a <strong>duty to examine</strong> - review the description, photos and video and\n  <strong>use the comments section</strong> to ask questions so the seller can respond openly and directly.\n  Visit the item if possible.</li>\n  <li>All listing information is <strong>certified by the seller</strong> (whether private or professional).</li>\n  <li><strong>Bidders Highway is not a party</strong> to the purchase agreement or the transaction.</li>\n</ul></div></div><div class=\"lg:w-1/4 mt-8 lg:mt-0\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-6\">Kategorien</h2><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 lg:block\"><li><a href=\"/de/questions\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Alle</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/buying\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent px-2 border-black! text-black! hover:text-black!\">Einkaufen</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/selling\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Verkaufen</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/bidding\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Bieten</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/documentation\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Dokumentation</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/account\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Konto</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/payment\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Zahlungen</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/shipping\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Transport</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/verification\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Verifizierung</a></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 pb-16\"><div class=\"w-full p-8 bg-amber-100 rounded sm:flex justify-between items-center\"><div><h2 class=\"font-serif text-2xl sm:text-4xl mb-4\">Weitere Fragen?</h2><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base mb-2 sm:mb-8\">Sie können uns eine E-Mail senden. Wir helfen Ihnen gerne weiter!</p><a href=\"mailto:support@biddershighway.com\" class=\"font-bold underline hover:text-neutral-800\">support@biddershighway.com</a></div><a href=\"mailto:support@biddershighway.com\" class=\"hidden sm:block\"><img src=\"/assets/contact-us-4411369c.svg\" alt=\"Contact us\" class=\"w-48 h-36\"></a></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 text-center py-8\"><a href=\"/de\" class=\"inline-block rounded-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors px-4 py-2 text-white bg-jaffa hover:bg-zest disabled:bg-yellow-700 disabled:text-neutral-300 px-6 py-3\">Alle unsere Autoauktionen ansehen</a></div></div></main>",
